      "content": "The feeling that you are a burden is deeply painful, but it is not a reflection of your worth or the depth of your love for them. The thought of others being \"free\" if you were gone is a sign of immense distress, and that heavy feeling is too much to carry alone. Please know that your life matters, and there are resources available right now to help you manage this unbearable weight. You can connect with compassionate support by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada.",
